<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Kandir sees rising 1997 privatization revs.</title>
<headline>Brazil Kandir sees rising 1997 privatization revs.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian privatization receipts may exceed 10 billion reais in 1997, nearly double those of 1996, Planning Minister Antonio Kandir said.</p>
<p>Kandir, speaking at an end-of-year cabinet meeting, said he expected privatization to speed up next year with the sale of federal and state-level companies.</p>
<p>-- William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358</p>
</text>
